, "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第八条期限争议"], "token_count": 123, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 563.172412109375, 133.24857177734376, 577.17744140625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9997422865458897}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 590.75810546875, 540.60849609375, 621.738916015625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992694146931171}], "snippet": "第八条期限争议\n\n如果另一制度规定30个自然日，应同时核对两份原文及适用依据。本文件没有说明哪份制度优先，不能仅凭严格程度或版本日期选择15天。对具体申请的适用制度应请求补充确认，并说明当前资料存在冲突。", "rrf_score": 0.031754, "bm25_score": 9.768605, "vector_score": 0.569056}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c013", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r013", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十三条期限问答"], "token_count": 223, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 184.18751220703126, 146.36192626953124, 195.64617919921875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9986509010195732}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 210.9244140625, 541.454541015625, 256.75908203125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9981319904327393}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 272.0373046875, 536.801416015625, 302.1693603515625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9984620551805239}], "snippet": "第十三条期限问答\n\n问：十五天是工作日吗？答：本文写的是15个自然日，包含周末与节假日。问：财务需要在15天内付款吗？答：15天是申请提交期限，本文没有规定付款时限。问：补开发票后期限重新开始吗？答：本文没有这一规定，不能自动重新起算。\n\n问：超过15天是否绝对不能报？答：本文没有规定超期处置、豁免条件和批准权限，不能推导出绝对结论。问：本制度是否只适用于某", "rrf_score": 0.031498, "bm25_score": 7.145014, "vector_score": 0.575392}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c014", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r014", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十四条冲突资料的核对清单"], "token_count": 225, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 322.1159423828125, 203.04544677734376, 334.4234130859375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989650157781748}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 348.85283203125, 546.953662109375, 379.4093017578125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990319925911573}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 392.5655517578125, 541.454541015625, 423.54638671875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9992972043427554}], "snippet": "第十四条冲突资料的核对清单\n\n发现其他制度给出不同期限时，应记录其文档ID、版本日期、适用范围、具体条款和是否包含明确替代声明。范围缺失时，不能假定两份文件适用于不同部门而消解冲突；日期较新也不足以证明旧制度失效。\n\n可以向制度管理方请求有效制度清单、批准文件或具体适用说明。没有获得这些依据之前，应明确保留15天与30天的冲突，不应向申请人承诺任一规则必然适", "rrf_score": 0.030579, "bm25_score": 8.543375, "vector_score": 0.551165}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c005", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r005", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第五条提交期限"], "token_count": 212, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 182.91431884765626, 135.7866455078125, 196.494970703125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9998433079038348}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [48.646304321289065, 211.3488037109375, 541.8775390625, 240.6320556640625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998851158789226}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 2, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 254.637109375, 542.300537109375, 285.1935546875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9989627904362148}], "snippet": "第五条提交期限\n\n报销期限为费用发生后15个自然日。本文未说明适用部门，也未说明是否替代其他报销制度。自然日包括周末和节假日，申请人不应自行改为工作日口径。申请材料应如实列明费用发生日期及提交日期。\n\n本资料未定义首日是否计入、截止时刻以及节假日顺延。若用户要求计算精确的最迟提交日，应先确认这些口径；本文只能支持“费用发生后15个自然日”的原则性表述，不能支", "rrf_score": 0.030214, "bm25_score": 4.103349, "vector_score": 0.581309}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c016", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r016", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十六条仍需补充的资料"], "token_count": 149, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 581.84580078125, 179.3568115234375, 594.153271484375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990662444721569}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 608.582666015625, 540.60849609375, 654.841748046875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998898540405517}], "snippet": "第十六条仍需补充的资料\n\n现有扫描资料缺少适用部门、正式批准状态、制度优先级、起算细则、补正对期限的影响、超期审批权限及支付时限。即使扫描内容能够完整识别，也不代表这些缺口已经补齐。资料管理方需要提供相应依据后，才能对具体争议给出确定处理意见。", "rrf_score": 0.029631, "bm25_score": 4.962932, "vector_score": 0.55452}]}}
